<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela H.L.Boulton Q2 Dec 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Venezuela H.L.Boulton Q2 Dec 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit 799 million bolivars vs 225 million bolivars</p>
<p>Revenues 6.1 bln bolivars vs 5.0 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Operating costs 5.3 bln bolivars vs 4.8 bln bolivars</p>
<p>NOTE: Periods ended December 31.</p>
<p>Results are consolidated and expressed in constant December 31, 1996 bolivars.</p>
<p>H.L. Boulton &amp; Co SACA is a holding company</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
